WEBVTT

00:01.720 --> 00:03.120
I don't know

00:10.960 --> 00:12.800
I don't care about the realm

00:12.880 --> 00:14.280
Or going north

00:14.720 --> 00:16.387
That's for you to consider

00:17.320 --> 00:18.400
But when you married me

00:18.480 --> 00:19.880
You promised me

00:20.040 --> 00:21.640
When we return to the north

00:21.720 --> 00:23.680
You'd take me to Bashang to break willow branches

00:23.760 --> 00:25.360
And return to Yong'an to admire flowers

00:25.440 --> 00:26.840
Alright

00:27.160 --> 00:27.960
How about

00:28.120 --> 00:29.800
I write you an IOU

00:30.600 --> 00:31.840
Just write

00:31.920 --> 00:32.960
Owe my wife

00:33.040 --> 00:34.880
A trip to Bashang to break willow branches

00:34.960 --> 00:36.960
And to Yong'an to admire flowers

00:40.360 --> 00:42.800
Do you know why I came to see you?

00:42.880 --> 00:44.547
What is it, my wife?

00:46.440 --> 00:47.760
If you

00:47.840 --> 00:49.240
Stay away too long

00:50.440 --> 00:52.160
I'll name the child myself

00:54.000 --> 00:55.400
What?

00:55.840 --> 00:57.240
I said

00:58.080 --> 01:00.080
You're going to be a father

01:07.160 --> 01:09.160
I'll return as soon as possible

01:09.440 --> 01:10.760
I promise
